
Description:

The tooling and documentation left behind by the removal of NNTP support
has been removed: the remotepurge utility, the mknewsgroups script, the
INN patch, and the NNTP administrator guide.  The news2mail mailbox
annotation, which only nntpd ever consulted, has been removed too.


Documentation:

The "Cyrus NNTP" page has been removed from the administrator guide, and
the remaining references to NNTP throughout the documentation have been
dropped.


Config changes:

The allownewnews option has been deprecated.


Upgrade instructions:

The /vendor/cmu/cyrus-imapd/news2mail annotation can no longer be set or
fetched, and cyradm's mboxconfig, setmetadata and getmetadata commands no
longer accept "news2mail" as a shorthand.  Any values still stored will
be ignored; they can be removed ahead of time with:

    cyradm> mboxconfig <mailbox> news2mail ""
